Added opt-in auto-linking by verified email. When switched on for a provider, a first login whose claims carry a verified address is attached to the existing account that owns that address instead of minting a new one — but only when the address is one this site proved itself with a magic link, and only when the provider asserts a literal `email_verified: true`. A provider's word alone is never enough: anyone able to register at that provider with a chosen address could otherwise walk into the matching Plone account. Off by default. @ericof
